Package: supralinux-kdeconnect-sftp
Architecture: any
Depends: kdeconnect,
         ${misc:Depends}
Description: native SFTP server for KDE Connect remote filesystems
 An ephemeral, single-user SFTP server used by the KDE Connect sftp
 plugin when a paired Linux device requests its filesystem.
 .
 The server listens on a random high port, accepts only the paired device's
 certificate key, exposes the user's home directory, and exits after the
 mount goes away.  It does not use sshd, port 22, ~/.ssh or authorized_keys.
